  "steps": [
    "Cut the cucumbers in half lengthwise. Using a small spoon, scoop out the entire inner portion and clean them well to create cucumber boats.",
    "Lightly mash the cooked rice until it becomes slightly sticky. Press and spread the rice evenly inside the cucumber boats.",
    "In a bowl, add the boiled chickpeas, avocado, Skyr, chilli oil, chopped jalapeño, and salt. Mash everything together until you get a creamy mixture.",
    "Spread the chickpea mixture evenly over the rice layer in each cucumber boat.",
    "Sprinkle sesame seeds on top and drizzle with Sriracha.",
    "Cut each cucumber half into 2–3 pieces to make bite-sized boats.",
    "For the dipping sauce, mix soy sauce with a little water, lemon juice, and honey.",
    "Serve the cucumber boats with the dipping sauce on the side, dip, and enjoy!"
  ],
